{
  "$comment": "Copy to config/models.json (gitignored), keep the providers you have keys for, and pick agents.primaryModel / agents.fallbackModel as '<provider name>/<model name>' from different providers. Keys are read from the environment variables named in apiKeyEnv and never stored in this file. Default (tested 2026-11-19 on Tasks A, B, C, free tiers only, $0): primary NVIDIA API Catalog nvidia/nemotron-3-ultra-550b-a55b, fallback Groq qwen/qwen3.8-27b, spare OpenRouter nvidia/nemotron-3-ultra-550b-a55b:free (configured, unused). The other providers are untested alternatives; check model ids against your account (GET <baseUrl>/models). Switching models is a config change plus `node scripts/setup-trueforge.mjs`.",
